Package: nimbusos-release
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 nimbusos-archive-keyring (>= ${binary:Version}),
 python3,
 python3-apt,
 gpgv,
 unattended-upgrades
Recommends: flatpak
Description: NimbusOS release information, update channel and update tool
 Identifies the system as NimbusOS (/usr/lib/os-release, with the Debian
 file kept as /usr/lib/os-release.debian) and connects it to the NimbusOS
 APT repository:
  - the repository source (stable channel) and apt pinning that lets the
    NimbusOS and Docker repositories supply only their own packages;
  - an unattended-upgrades policy that installs Debian security updates
    daily and never restarts the machine;
  - nimbus-update, which checks, installs and configures updates (channel
    stable or beta, policy automatic, notify or off), with its daily timers;
  - a one-time setup of the Flathub remote for Flatpak.
